      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقاتهُ</span></b> : see 1, first and second sentences. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also <i>He kept, preserved, guarded,</i> or <i>protected,
him.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقات عَلَى الشَّىْءِ</span>, (S, O,
K, *) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقاته</span>, (K,) <i>He had power,</i> or <i>ability,
to do, effect, accomplish, attain,</i> or <i>compass, the
thing.</i> (S, O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See, again, 1, latter half,
in two places.

